,"historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Caterers","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Meww6RIE4cFL_kG0aRlbAA","review_id":"1dNLFJROPLaPkR8dSsKsgQ","date":"2017-02-21T16:26:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9475539326667786,"text_excerpt":"On a mom and daughter lunch date, on a lovely Sunday, I took my mom here. She loves her bbq and this was the first time for the two of us - somethinf we strive to do is discover new things together. Blue Oak did not disappoint. We arrived to find that they were pretty much sold out of everything. No worries! We arent pickyeaters when it comes to some good cue! We had brisket, wings, brussel sprouts and cracklins! The cracklins...you get your choice of sauces but, for me, I like them best naked. Perfectly fried with just enough crunch, just enough buttery fat, and seasoned perfectly. The brisket was equally awesome! Tender, juicy, and really good with the sauce on the side. Several to choo..."},{"business_id":"Meww6RIE4cFL_kG0aRlbAA","review_id":"5q8MeBrsVOgPod7Vmm4EOQ","date":"2016-07-07T00:56:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9466876983642578,"text_excerpt":"I don't honestly like BBQ--never really had a taste for it, but my boo does and it was his birthday last weekend, so we gave it a go. Though I didn't order any meat, (insert vegetarian stereotype here) I had the sides (Brussel sprouts, Mac n cheese, and the slaw) and all of them were outstanding. Seriously so good I would go back for any of them any day. Bae loved the brisket and especially the pulled pork. Our only meh comment would be that the sauces were really thin and kind of vinegary except for the jerk sauce which was really tasty. Way to go Blue Oak! See you again soon."},{"business_id":"Meww6RIE4cFL_kG0aRlbAA","review_id":"Dy2c6OrDN405CF7vqMmqXQ","date":"2016-07-08T21:54:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9448190331459045,"text_excerpt":"One of my favorite foods is BBQ so I was excited to try this place! I got the pulled pork plate and the pork was delicious! Full of that smokey flavor and not at all fatty. The brussel sprouts were very good as well! They're sweet but tangy and crunchy all at the same time. Red beans and rice was the side of the day. They were decent but I've had better. Overall, it was a good experience!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Meww6RIE4cFL_kG0aRlbAA","photo_id":"qaQXD8_Wm-HHV50KRLh9Vg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qaQXD8_Wm-HHV50KRLh9Vg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8450814485549927},{"business_id":"Meww6RIE4cFL_kG0aRlbAA","photo_id":"5Us6_rh0rqxpmSIUSzNEZw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/5Us6_rh0rqxpmSIUSzNEZw.jpg","visua